# True Will (outlands 145), the quest's own var at the completion: accepted, trueWillCS 2, the Large Trick Box and
# Quest[5][145]Prog 1 (GMs). Leodarion (the second talk of a pair: his default 89 first): 99; finished:
# npcUtil.completeQuest (the Ninja Chainmail, Norg fame +20, the title, trueWillCS 0, completed), then the box taken.
# npcUtil.completeQuest does no cleanup: Quest[5][145]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
char zone=Rabao pos=-49.513,7.999,41.323 job=NIN lvl=75
quest Outlands.TrueWill accepted
charvar trueWillCS 2
keyitem LargeTrickBox
charvar Quest[5][145]Prog 1             # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trigger Leodarion                       # default turn: 89
finish
trigger Leodarion                       # script, 2 and the Large Trick Box: 99
finish                                  # the Ninja Chainmail; fame +20; the title; completed, Prog kept; the box taken
